==Description==
The '''Doge Nametag''' is a {{Color|Legendary}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|5,000}}.

The '''Doge Nametag''' is very similar to the [[Default Nametag]], as it has white text and a black outline. However, it also has images of Shiba Inus appear behind it, one of it being the {{RLinkC|151784320|Doge}} accessory from Roblox, an edited version of the the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/doge Doge] meme and a Shiba Inu with what appears to be human eyes. The third one no longer appears as the original image appears to have been removed by Roblox.

